{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act38side_level_act38side_st02","storyGroup":"act38side","storySort":10,"storyDependence":"act38side_level_act38side_04_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"PV-ST-2","storyName":"《复仇禁制令》","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"为了家族的“体面”，老威尼斯做主让老裁缝爷孙离开。英格丽归还家徽，正式退出家族，告别曾将自己视如己出的老威尼斯。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act38side/level_act38side_st02","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act38side_st02","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":8,"next":10,"characters":["翁贝托","安东尼奥","老威尼斯","卢奇诺","英格丽","倔强的小女孩","怯怯的小女孩","家族成员"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_bg_33_g5_srcpark.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_darkness_03_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":9},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1543_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":11},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1543_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"翁贝托","text":"安东尼奥先生，我已经给法布里齐奥先生量完体了。","id":13,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_1543_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"翁贝托","text":"店里正好就有他想要的料子，赶一赶，这套衣服能如期做好，不耽误你们的事情。","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_1543_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":15},{"type":"charslot","id":16},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":17},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"......爸爸？","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"（点头）","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":22},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":23},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1543_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"翁贝托","text":"我就赶紧带着卢奇诺先回去了。","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_1543_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":26},{"type":"charslot","id":27},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1555_1#1$1","id":28},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1555_1#1$1","id":29},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":30},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","duration":"0.5","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"50,0","id":31},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":32},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","duration":"0.5","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-50,0","id":33},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":34},{"type":"charslot","id":35},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#7$1","id":36},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1543_1#1$1","id":37},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":38},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"100,0","duration":"0.8","id":39},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1543_1#1$1","id":40},{"type":"delay","time":"1.2","id":41},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"爷爷，这些人压根没打算放我们走......","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":44},{"type":"charslot","id":45},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#2$1","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"无妨。","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":48},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","id":49},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":50},{"type":"charslot","id":51},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#7$1","posfrom":"100,0","posto":"100,0","id":52},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1543_1#1$1","id":53},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":54},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","posfrom":"100,0","posto":"50,0","duration":"0.8","id":55},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-50,0","duration":"0.8","id":56},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#2$1","posfrom":"-250,0","posto":"-100,0","duration":"1","focus":"m","id":57},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":58},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"你们放心走就是了。","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1543_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"翁贝托","text":"英格丽女士，那你......","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ab/Avg_avg_npc_1543_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"恐怕我得留下处理一些家族事务。","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"安东，你应该明白老爷的意思了，让你的人撤走。","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":66},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#8$1","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"不能这么处理，爸爸。","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"翁贝托已经向我保证过了。客人总不能一直留在家里，安东。","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"但是，英格丽，你这样做，的确让我们很难堪。","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":72},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#7$1","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","focus":"m","id":73},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1543_1#6$1","posfrom":"-50,0","posto":"-50,0","focus":"m","id":74},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#2$1","posfrom":"-100,0","posto":"-100,0","focus":"m","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"抱歉。","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"他们活着对我很重要。","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"（走。）","id":79,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":80},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","id":81},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"300,0","duration":"1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","focus":"m","id":82},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","posfrom":"-50,0","posto":"200,0","duration":"1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","focus":"m","id":83},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":84},{"type":"charslot","id":85},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"唉，英格丽，从我到了新沃尔西尼之后，就一直盼着能和你见上一面。","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"但不该是这样。","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#4$1","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"威尼斯自家人的刀从不向内。","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":91},{"type":"dialog","id":92},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":93},{"type":"charslot","id":94},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":95},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5e/Avg_bg_56_g3_newvolsiniialley_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":96},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":97},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":98},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act28side/m_avg_wasteland_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":99,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":100},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1543_1#5$1","duration":"1","id":101},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":102},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1543_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"翁贝托","text":"咳咳——走吧，卢奇诺。","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_npc_1543_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"糟糕！","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1543_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"翁贝托","text":"怎么了？","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_npc_1543_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"药！","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"给您取的药还在那个房间，还有本来要送的货......被抓来的时候，他们搜了我的身——爷爷，我、我回去拿。","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1543_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"翁贝托","text":"算了，孩子。","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_npc_1543_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1543_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"翁贝托","text":"威尼斯的宅子和德蒙塔诺隔着好几个街区，路还有得走呢。","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_npc_1543_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":116},{"type":"text","text":"卢奇诺回头看，威尼斯的人没有从宅子里追出来。","id":117},{"type":"text","text":"老裁缝的手放在了他的肩头。他清晰地感受到了老人在颤抖，仿佛刚才和老威尼斯的见面已经耗光了他的力气。","id":118},{"type":"text","text":"更要命的是，他发现自己的肩膀原来还这么瘦弱，如果爷爷真的倒下，自己甚至可能撑不住他。","id":119},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"爷爷......","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1543_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"翁贝托","text":"嗯？","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_1543_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"没、没什么。","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":126},{"type":"text","text":"卢奇诺有一肚子问题，他问不出口。但他突然想到了一些很模糊的画面。也是像现在这样，两个人走在一条同样陌生的路上。","id":127},{"type":"dialog","id":128},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":129},{"type":"charslot","id":130},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":131},{"type":"gridbg","imagegroup":"38_g21_skystarry_L1/38_g21_skystarry_r1/38_g21_skystarry_L2/38_g21_skystarry_r2","solidwidth":"1280/1280/1280/1280","solidheight":"720/720/720/720","x":"-1280","id":132},{"type":"largebgtween","duration":"80","yFrom":"0","yTo":"300","block":"false","id":133},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":134},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":135},{"type":"text","text":"三岁，还是四岁？","id":136},{"type":"text","text":"载具经过农庄，老人从上面蹦下来，没有站稳，踉跄着摔倒。","id":137},{"type":"text","text":"自己看着他走到面前，盯着他脸上的泥巴，还有他腰间的尺和剪刀，害怕地哭出声来。老人紧张得手足无措——","id":138},{"type":"text","text":"那时他脸上的皱纹要比现在少很多。","id":139},{"type":"text","text":"老人牵着自己离开了农庄，路不知道通向哪里。应该是害怕吧，自己的哭声越来越大，被吵醒的羽兽扑棱着飞远。","id":140},{"type":"text","text":"“别哭别哭，卢奇诺。”","id":141},{"type":"text","text":"“翁贝托，说点什么呢，说点什么呢......爷爷给你讲个童话故事吧......”","id":142},{"type":"text","text":"“每一位猎人进入荒野前都会遇见狼。”","id":143},{"type":"text","text":"“狼说，柘木做的弓很坚韧，石头磨出的刀很锋利，但要想活下来，就脱下你们为保护皮肉而穿上的衣物，唯独那不属于荒野......”","id":144},{"type":"text","text":"“哈哈，竟然不哭了，你这孩子，竟然喜欢这些故事？爷爷还知道很多......”","id":145},{"type":"dialog","id":146},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":147},{"type":"charslot","id":148},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":149},{"type":"gridbg","id":150},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#2$1","id":151},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1543_1#1$1","id":152},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5e/Avg_bg_56_g3_newvolsiniialley_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":153},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":154},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"爷爷。","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1543_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"翁贝托","text":"嗯？","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_1543_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"您能再教我缝一遍扣子吗？","id":160,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":161},{"type":"dialog","id":162},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":163},{"type":"charslot","id":164},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":165},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_bg_33_g7_reception.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":166},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":167},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":168,"musicid":2},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":169},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#2$1","duration":"1","id":170},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":171},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":172},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"我很开心你愿意听我这个老家伙的建议，留下叙叙旧，英格丽。","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1e/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"我本以为你会像当初那样，握着刀，头也不回地离开。","id":175,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1e/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"我也以为，远走东国会让我平静下来。但您也看到了，我逃不开。","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"踏进这里的时候，我就没有想过能那么轻松地离开。","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":179},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#7$1","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"英格丽，你一定要走？","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":182},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":183},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"你可以试着拦住我。","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"老爷说得对，威尼斯自家人的刀从不向内。","id":186,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":187},{"type":"text","text":"沃尔珀摸出了一件随身携带的东西。","id":188},{"type":"text","text":"安东尼奥很清楚那是什么——家徽，当年他决定跟随法布里齐奥时，拿到了同样的东西。","id":189},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"你决定了吗？","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"原谅我，老爷。我有一种预感，接下来我要做的事您不会赞同。","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"如果这个家徽成了我解决心结的阻碍，我也别无他法。","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/20/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"......这很自私，孩子。","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"我知道。","id":199,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":200},{"type":"dialog","id":201},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":202},{"type":"charslot","id":203},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":204},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"0.7","block":"true","id":205},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_bg_33_g5_srcpark.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":206},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":207},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.4","id":208,"musicid":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":209},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#7$1","duration":"1","id":210},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"孩子，你为什么用石头砸我？","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1e/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"倔强的小女孩","text":"误伤，是误伤。我本来是要砸那几个逃走的家伙，你、你正好经过......","id":214},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#6$1","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"你脸上的伤......是刚刚那些孩子弄的？","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":217},{"type":"dialogue","name":"倔强的小女孩","text":"他们说我的耳朵很大很奇怪，说我不是鲁珀，不配待在叙拉古。","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"倔强的小女孩","text":"你没看见他们伤得更重吗？打不过我，嘴巴会说有什么用，下次我要把他们的牙拔掉！","id":219},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#7$1","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"哈哈，那你可比他们像鲁珀多了。","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1e/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"你的家人呢？","id":222,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1e/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"倔强的小女孩","text":"......死了。我们逃难来到这里，爸爸妈妈去市政府申请救济，正好遇上了一场帮派斗殴。","id":224},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#6$1","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"你没有地方可去？","id":226,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"倔强的小女孩","text":"嗯。","id":228},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#7$1","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"那你愿意跟我走吗？","id":230,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1e/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"倔强的小女孩","text":"你需要我替你打架吗？","id":232},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#7$1","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"......这个等你长大一点再说。","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1e/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"我的女儿贝拉，身体不太好，平时不怎么出门，正好缺一个玩伴......","id":235,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1e/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"倔强的小女孩","text":"只要她愿意和沃尔珀玩，我无所谓。","id":237},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#6$1","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"这么干脆？","id":239,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"倔强的小女孩","text":"我力气还小，一直待在公园，打不过所有人。","id":241},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#7$1","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"拿着这个。","id":243,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1e/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"倔强的小女孩","text":"这是什么？","id":245},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#7$1","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"威尼斯的家徽。接下它，意味着我们成为了一家人。","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1e/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"倔强的小女孩","text":"......但我不是鲁珀。","id":249},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#7$1","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"我的家里很多人都不是鲁珀，但我们的联系比其他任何一个家族都要紧密。你以后也会懂的。","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1e/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":252},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":253},{"type":"charslot","id":254},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_bg_33_g4_srctheater.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":255},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":256},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":257},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#7$1","duration":"1","id":258},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"别藏在妈妈腿后面啦，身子可以遮住，但我已经看见你的尾巴啦。","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1e/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"怯怯的小女孩","text":"......","id":262},{"type":"dialog","id":263},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":264},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":265},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":266},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":267},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"这就是丽萨？","id":268,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"这孩子和你小时候完全不一样，英格丽。","id":269,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"对不起。没有提前通知您就把她带了回来。","id":271,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"神社那群老古董发现了这孩子，我不能让她继续留在东国。","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"因为所谓的九尾血脉，就得一辈子待在神社里，和她爸爸那样，被人像个有求必应的吉祥物一样供着，太蠢。","id":275,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"她的房间已经收拾出来了。等到适应叙拉古的生活后，可以让她和家族的其他孩子一起上学。","id":277,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"老爷，我希望丽萨离东国那套玩意远一点，但也不想让她学习所谓叙拉古的生存之道。","id":279,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"......","id":281,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"去跟安东打个招呼吧，给这孩子请个专门的老师，音乐、文学、绘画、星象、源石技艺......她喜欢什么就学什么。","id":283,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":284},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"您不怪我？","id":285,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"你还在我面前，英格丽。","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"你出刀的手有变慢吗？你执行的任务有变少吗？","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":289},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"没有。","id":290,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":291},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"那你就依然是家族里最适合接过我担子的人。","id":292,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"嗯。","id":294,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"再说，我很喜欢这个孩子。","id":296,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"所以当务之急是，怎么让她不怕我，哈哈。","id":298,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1e/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":299},{"type":"dialog","id":300},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":301},{"type":"charslot","id":302},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":303},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_bg_33_g11_mansionhall.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":304},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":305},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":306},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.4","id":307,"musicid":4},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":308},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#2$1","duration":"0.5","id":309},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":310},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":311},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"还是没有结果？","id":312,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":313},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"我挑断了那个家伙手脚和尾巴处的筋，但他到死也不肯吐出具体是谁策划了那起刺杀，只是一个劲地说什么也不知道......","id":314,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"和之前那十七个人一样。","id":315,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":316},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"......丽萨刚刚睡着。","id":317,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"这孩子的感染情况很严重，源石结晶已经蔓延到了肩膀，您没必要亲自照顾她。","id":319,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"我做了防护。再说，丽萨是因为我才受的伤。英格丽，你对此什么都没有说。","id":321,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"丽萨是个单纯的孩子，她不知道这段时间外面发生着多么可怕的事情，只是本能地察觉到了宅子里的人都很紧张。","id":322,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"你去救安东尼奥的时候，她想着待在我身边，你就能少担心一些。","id":323,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":324},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"......","id":325,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/20/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"罗德岛的人已经到了。","id":327,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"......原来你一早就为丽萨找好了去处。","id":329,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"家族可以在叙拉古境内为丽萨找到最好的矿石病医生，你没必要瞒着我私下联系那家叫罗德岛的公司。","id":330,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":331},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"......英格丽，你们没必要离开。","id":332,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":333},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"西西里夫人明天就会亲自到达特尔尼城，唐克雷蒂家族与威尼斯家族不得不坐在谈判桌上。","id":334,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"这个时候，您必须将我从家族中除名，就像唐克雷蒂的人到死都不会承认他们策划了直接针对您的刺杀。","id":335,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"我记得这个话题我们已经聊过了。","id":336,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"......是。","id":338,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"对不起，老爷。家徽，还给您。","id":340,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"留着。英格丽，留着吧。","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"我默许了你为丽萨复仇，我喜欢那孩子。不然你以为自己这半个月以来的行动，家族为什么完全没有人阻拦你？","id":343,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"我们是一家人，英格丽。","id":344,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":345},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":346},{"type":"charslot","id":347},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":348},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"3","id":349},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","amount":"0","block":"true","id":350},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_bg_33_g7_reception.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":351},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":352},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":353},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#2$1","duration":"1","id":354},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":355},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#3$1","id":356},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"“我们是一家人。”","id":357,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/20/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#2$1","id":358},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"老爷，这枚家徽是您的祝福，也是我的枷锁。","id":359,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"......","id":360,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":361},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"......她在罗德岛上过得怎么样？","id":362,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#2$1","id":363},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"丽萨现在算是那家公司的员工，前几年她还去了趟莱塔尼亚，帮罗德岛调查一起和感染者有关的失踪案。","id":364,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"她在寄给我的信里还故意瞒着不说，我后来去看她的时候问了她的朋友，大家都说她表现得很好。","id":365,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#3$1","id":366},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"我很想丽萨这孩子。","id":367,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#2$1","id":368},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"如果她愿意回来，我不会阻拦......老爷，您很清楚我不是来叙旧的。","id":369,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"或许您当年坚持让我留下这枚家徽时有很多打算——","id":370,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":371},{"type":"text","text":"英格丽看了一眼默默站在一旁的安东尼奥。","id":372},{"type":"charslot","id":373},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#7$1","id":374},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"英格丽，留着它吧。爸爸向我提起过，狂欢节结束后，我们可以一起回一趟蒙特卢佩。","id":375,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#2$1","id":376},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"嗯？","id":377,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":378},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"安东，现在说这件事还太早。","id":379,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#7$1","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"西西里夫人或许会松口的不是吗？","id":381,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"......","id":383,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#8$1","id":384},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"既然狂欢节这个曾经令她深恶痛绝的节日都能以另一种形式重新出现在叙拉古，相比之下，英格丽犯下的事情不值一提。","id":385,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"更何况，已经过去了六年。如今的唐克雷蒂家族早已不值得西西里夫人放在心上。","id":386,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"这六年时间，我靠着当年保下来的那最后一家载具工厂，吃掉了唐克雷蒂家族在特尔尼城的全部产业。","id":387,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"西西里夫人看重结果。这就是结果。","id":388,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":389},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"你是这么看的吗，安东？","id":390,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#4$1","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"是的，爸爸。","id":392,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#2$1","id":393},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"安东尼奥在您身边做得很好，如今家里已经不需要我。","id":394,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"安东这孩子......贝拉去世后，他对我多少有些戒心，我能感觉到。","id":396,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#2$1","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"......","id":398,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0c/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":399},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"贝拉死了，他这个女婿还能有多少价值......他大概是这么想的，所以一直让自己忙得像一只陀螺。","id":400,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#6$1","id":401},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"爸爸，我——","id":402,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":403},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"我并不希望你有太多压力。家族的地盘已经足够大，哪怕在这刚刚建成的新沃尔西尼，威尼斯也有了一定的话语权。","id":404,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"你已经做得够好了，安东。","id":405,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"我看着英格丽离开，看着贝拉死去。我真正在意的，是我身边已经不剩下多少的“家人”......我也是个老人了。","id":406,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"我不想再失去你们中的任何一个人。","id":407,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#7$1","id":408},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"......","id":409,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#2$1","id":410},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"......","id":411,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4026_vulpis_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":412},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":413},{"type":"text","text":"英格丽看着眼前确实已经两鬓斑白的老人，没再说别的话。","id":414},{"type":"dialog","id":415},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_mummyhit","id":416},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":417},{"type":"text","text":"她将家徽放在了桌上。","id":418},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#6$1","id":419},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"英格丽，你听到爸爸的话了，至少别是现在——","id":420,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":421},{"type":"text","text":"安东尼奥的话没有说完，英格丽已经转过了身。","id":422},{"type":"dialog","id":423},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":424},{"type":"charslot","id":425},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":426},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$lab_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_sys_lab_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":427,"musicid":5},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8d/Avg_56_i06.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1","yScale":"1","id":428},{"type":"imagetween","xFrom":"0","yFrom":"0","xTo":"-20","yTo":"-40","duration":"80","xScaleFrom":"1","yScaleFrom":"1","xScaleTo":"1.15","yScaleTo":"1.15","block":"false","id":429},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":430},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":431},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"抱歉，老爷......","id":432},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"我能理解您的苦衷，但......我做不到。","id":433},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"英格丽？","id":434},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"一直以来，除了杀人，我能帮您做的事情并不多。","id":435},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"一个杀手再顶尖，也不可能成为“小威尼斯”。安东尼奥比我更适合这个位置，我的离开不算多大的损失。","id":436},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"这六年，您应该早就发现这一点了。在您心里，您对我是失望的。","id":437},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"......","id":438},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"但我又何尝不是为迟迟找不到丽萨受伤的真相失望呢？","id":439},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"矿石病是不治之症。您比谁都清楚，我为什么回到叙拉古。","id":440},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"六年前没有找出来的那个人，我会找到他，然后让他偿命......除此之外，我没有别的事想做。","id":441},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"但丢下家徽，转身就走，你知道这意味着什么。","id":442},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"意味着我有可能站在您的对立面。","id":443},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"......","id":444},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"我不保证自己不会伤害家里人。","id":445},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"哪怕这样，我也会为您留最后的体面。这是我唯一能答应您的事情。","id":446},{"type":"dialog","id":447},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":448},{"type":"charslot","id":449},{"type":"image","id":450},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":451},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":452},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":453},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#7$1","duration":"0.5","id":454},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":455},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"爸爸，我可以再去劝劝她......","id":456,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":457},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"不必了。","id":458,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":459},{"type":"text","text":"老人抚摸着手中的家徽，然后小心地放到了自己的怀中。","id":460},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":461},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"英格丽的性格，我们都很清楚。","id":462,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"她认定的事，不会轻易更改的。这枚家徽我会替她保管，等她想通了，我会还给她。","id":463,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#7$1","id":464},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"......","id":465,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":466},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"最近你也少露面吧，刚好多在家里陪陪我。","id":467,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#7$1","id":468},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"可公司的事......","id":469,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":470},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"你自己找来的人手，难道你自己都信不过他们吗？","id":471,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#4$1","id":472},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"我知道了。","id":473,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#5$1","id":474},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"虽然我不怎么插手你在新沃尔西尼的工作，但不代表我对家里的事一无所知。","id":475,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"翁贝托·德蒙塔诺是我的老朋友，他一向知道分寸，不要再去打扰他们了。","id":476,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#4$1","id":477},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"......是。","id":478,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":479},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"我听到英格丽问你，你查到了丽萨受伤的真相？","id":480,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#4$1","id":481},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"只是一些线索，毕竟时间已经过去太久了。","id":482,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":483},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"是吗？安东，有些事情的对错，你大可自己判断......","id":484,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"但一旦涉及家族的面子，想清楚之后再去做。","id":485,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#4$1","id":486},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"好的。","id":487,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":488},{"type":"dialog","id":489},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":490},{"type":"charslot","id":491},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":492},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_bg_33_g11_mansionhall.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":493},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.7","id":494},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":495},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness02_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness02_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":496,"musicid":6},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":497},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#9$1","duration":"0.5","id":498},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":499},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"......","id":500,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/eb/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":501},{"type":"charslot","id":502},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","id":503},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1555_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":504},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":505},{"type":"dialogue","name":"家族成员","text":"安东尼奥，新消息！","id":506,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f8/Avg_avg_npc_1555_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"家族成员","text":"根据卡彭和甘比诺搞来的情报，我们丢掉的那批货找到了，在港口。","id":507,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f8/Avg_avg_npc_1555_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"家族成员","text":"但、但是......被人藏在花车里给点了。","id":508,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f8/Avg_avg_npc_1555_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#8$1","id":509},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"......谁动的手呢？","id":510,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1555_1#1$1","id":511},{"type":"dialogue","name":"家族成员","text":"不确定。","id":512,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f8/Avg_avg_npc_1555_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"家族成员","text":"警察已经把卡车工会的头子，那个叫“伊雷妮”的人带走调查了。她......","id":513,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f8/Avg_avg_npc_1555_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#3$1","id":514},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"......","id":515,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ec/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":516},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":517},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":518},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":519},{"type":"image","id":520},{"type":"charslot","id":521}],"characters":["翁贝托","安东尼奥","老威尼斯","卢奇诺","英格丽","倔强的小女孩","怯怯的小女孩","家族成员"]}